<%#
# The messages of a setting that was sent and not saved: in the card, in Russian, red. The value the admin entered is still in the control.

## Local variables:

- `slot`: a `SuperAdmin::AiModelsPage::Slot`.
%>
<% if slot.invalid? %>
  <div class="admin-slot__errors" role="alert" data-testid="slot-errors" data-error-for="<%= slot.key %>">
    <% slot.errors.each do |message| %>
      <p><%= message.to_s.upcase_first %></p>
    <% end %>
  </div>
<% end %>
